        &lt;description&gt;As a developer, I want to use Integration Hub ETL (Extract, Transform, Load) with the Identification and Reconciliation Engine (IRE) to load data from a file into ServiceNow. This will ensure the data is transformed, mapped, and properly reconciled against the CMDB to prevent duplicates and maintain data integrity. This story builds upon the previously established identification rules for Windows Server class CIs where "File Load" is set as primary for Operating System attributes and secondary for Asset Tag and Serial Number attributes.&amp;#13;
&amp;#13;
Import the CSV file attached to this story. (I can validate the file includes data for both "Windows Server" and "Extra Windows Server" classes&amp;#13;
I can see the file contains Operating System, Asset Tag, and Serial Number attributes)&amp;#13;
